// Catalyst moveset (WP-052). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Weapon classes": physical moves only: a stylus or reliquary used in melee, 1.6 m reach. The spells are WP-055's.
// Frame numbers are tuning unless a spec line says otherwise. Dodges (roll, backstep) are
// shared in common.ron; the critical pair is shared in crits.ron, and the weapon's
// crit_mult_percent (100) sets the crit.
